  turnin 3505                         -- Kaldorei Tome of Summoning
  accept 91497                        -- Sin'dorei Tome of Summoning: Seals of the Sin'dorei

step Seals of the Sin'dorei
  tip Each of the camp's three officers (53) carries a seal: Lieutenant Suncrest in the middle of the camp, Ranger Lydrea at its eastern end, and Magister Hawkhelm, who walks its western half: take him on the east side of his walk, where the arrow points.
  tip Careful: the Blackmaw Thrall, a level 55-57 elite, stands at the camp's western edge, close to the far end of Hawkhelm's walk: wait for Hawkhelm to come back east.
  collect 246725 quest 91497.1        -- Seal of the Warden, from Lieutenant Suncrest
  collect 246721 quest 91497.2        -- Seal of the Warrior, from Magister Hawkhelm
  collect 246722 quest 91497.3        -- Seal of the Ranger, from Ranger Lydrea

